WEBVTT

01:23.390 --> 01:28.870
[A Splendid Match]

01:29.550 --> 01:31.850
[Episode 38]

01:46.870 --> 01:48.000
Where are you going?

01:50.590 --> 01:51.920
Leaving the capital for a case.

01:51.920 --> 01:52.759
I'll go with you.

01:52.759 --> 01:54.759
Why do you think you can come with me?

01:57.870 --> 01:58.560
Since we're here,

01:58.560 --> 01:59.960
let's make things clear.

02:01.640 --> 02:02.950
From now on, don't follow me

02:02.950 --> 02:03.790
wherever I go.

02:04.510 --> 02:06.110
Stop meddling in my affairs,

02:07.310 --> 02:09.039
and stop flattering yourself.

02:10.360 --> 02:11.240
Don't mistake

02:11.240 --> 02:12.040
my indulgence

02:13.080 --> 02:14.810
these past days for affection.

02:15.680 --> 02:16.470
Go back.

02:17.120 --> 02:18.780
Go back to where you came from.

02:19.680 --> 02:21.560
You're not going
to investigate a case at all.

02:21.560 --> 02:22.560
You want to accompany Gu Jinchao

02:22.560 --> 02:24.960
to the frontier
to find Chen Yanyun, right?

02:25.800 --> 02:27.060
None of your business.

02:27.360 --> 02:28.020
Step aside!

02:28.079 --> 02:28.710
I won't!

02:32.030 --> 02:33.560
The frontier is so dangerous.

02:33.560 --> 02:34.560
Such a large diplomatic mission

02:34.560 --> 02:36.220
disappeared without a trace.

02:36.240 --> 02:37.400
With only you and Li Xianhuai,

02:37.400 --> 02:38.310
how could that possibly work?

02:38.310 --> 02:39.120
My Lady.

02:41.910 --> 02:42.840
My Lady.

02:43.550 --> 02:44.360
Master

02:44.430 --> 02:46.360
wants you back at once.

02:51.190 --> 02:52.800
You actually told my father.

02:53.680 --> 02:55.470
My Lady, please.

02:59.470 --> 03:00.410
I won't go back.

03:00.680 --> 03:01.680
Get lost, all of you!

03:01.680 --> 03:02.750
Then don't blame me

03:02.750 --> 03:03.880
for being impolite.

03:04.240 --> 03:04.840
Do it.

03:07.750 --> 03:08.660
Let go of me!

03:08.800 --> 03:10.750
Ye Xian! Ye Xian!

03:11.240 --> 03:12.480
Ye Xian, come back!

03:12.630 --> 03:13.430
You can't go!

03:14.310 --> 03:15.260
Ye Xian!

03:16.079 --> 03:16.610
Let's go.

03:16.840 --> 03:17.520
Let go of me!

03:17.520 --> 03:19.360
Hyah!

03:30.910 --> 03:32.710
-Are you alright?
-Are you okay?

03:34.280 --> 03:35.100
Help me up.

03:36.040 --> 03:36.680
Master.

03:36.680 --> 03:37.240
How is it?

03:37.310 --> 03:38.510
What did you find out?

03:38.560 --> 03:40.079
Why are there so many refugees?

03:40.079 --> 03:40.940
I asked around.

03:41.000 --> 03:42.470
They are all from Shicheng.

03:42.470 --> 03:43.120
They said a large group of remnants

03:43.120 --> 03:43.960
of Chunyuan appeared out of nowhere

03:43.960 --> 03:45.790
and attacked the envoy mission.

03:46.030 --> 03:47.960
Now the fate of over
a hundred people is unknown.

03:47.960 --> 03:49.120
Some say they were taken
by the Chunyuan remnants

03:49.120 --> 03:50.150
to Beiman.

03:50.360 --> 03:51.630
Others say they were all killed

03:51.630 --> 03:53.000
and their bodies dumped in the mountains.

03:53.000 --> 03:53.910
The border market had been doing fine,

03:53.910 --> 03:55.190
but chaos suddenly broke out.

03:55.190 --> 03:56.280
Rumors of war are spreading,

03:56.280 --> 03:57.740
so they are rushing south.

03:58.870 --> 04:00.280
Tell everyone to stay alert.

04:00.280 --> 04:01.680
We are almost at Shicheng.

04:01.680 --> 04:02.240
Yes.

04:02.840 --> 04:04.080
Also, Master,

04:04.470 --> 04:06.100
Kuren Ridge is just ahead.

04:06.520 --> 04:07.590
Since ancient times, those who

04:07.590 --> 04:09.080
cross Kuren Ridge rarely survive.

04:09.080 --> 04:09.750
Everyone

04:10.310 --> 04:11.630
is terrified.

04:14.710 --> 04:15.520
Tell everyone

04:16.750 --> 04:17.899
that the reward for this journey

04:17.899 --> 04:18.829
will be tripled.

04:19.160 --> 04:20.420
Once we return safely,

04:21.269 --> 04:22.079
the Ji family

04:22.160 --> 04:23.000
will reward each of you

04:23.000 --> 04:24.830
with an additional 100 taels of silver.

04:24.830 --> 04:26.160
I expect you all to stay vigilant

04:26.160 --> 04:27.000
and fear nothing ahead.

04:27.000 --> 04:27.430
Yes.

04:27.950 --> 04:28.480
Yes.

05:37.510 --> 05:38.000
My Lord.

05:38.600 --> 05:40.159
The bandits in both areas
have been dealt with.

05:40.159 --> 05:40.920
As long as Miss Gu's convoy

05:40.920 --> 05:42.390
passes through within the next two hours,

05:42.390 --> 05:44.320
we can guarantee her safe passage.

05:44.480 --> 05:45.040
Got it.

05:46.310 --> 05:46.840
Let's go.

05:47.360 --> 05:47.800
Yes.

05:49.680 --> 05:50.240
My Lord,

05:50.600 --> 05:52.530
I really can't help but ask.

05:52.950 --> 05:53.630
What's so secret about

05:53.630 --> 05:54.720
clearing the way for Miss Gu

05:54.720 --> 05:55.830
on this journey?

05:56.480 --> 05:57.630
Why can't we just tell her,

05:57.630 --> 05:59.490
and why must we part ways with her?

06:00.600 --> 06:01.360
If she knew

06:01.360 --> 06:02.820
I wanted to accompany her,

06:03.040 --> 06:05.300
she would try every means to send me away.

06:06.070 --> 06:07.370
Instead of that,

06:07.950 --> 06:09.500
I might as well walk ahead

06:09.520 --> 06:10.920
and clear the way for her.

06:11.390 --> 06:12.310
We can show up when we get to Shicheng.

06:12.310 --> 06:13.440
It won't be too late.

06:23.090 --> 06:24.430
[Fully Occupied Today]

06:26.460 --> 06:29.210
[Fully Occupied Today]

06:27.600 --> 06:28.720
Are there no rooms left either?

06:28.720 --> 06:29.520
Exactly.

06:29.720 --> 06:31.450
Shicheng only has this one inn.

06:31.480 --> 06:32.480
At first they said there were no rooms,

06:32.480 --> 06:34.010
no matter how much money I offered.

06:34.010 --> 06:35.430
But as soon as they heard
I was from the Ji family,

06:35.430 --> 06:36.480
they suddenly changed their story

06:36.480 --> 06:37.920
and made two rooms available.

06:37.920 --> 06:39.050
Isn't that strange?

06:44.610 --> 06:45.250
[Map of Great Yan]

07:03.360 --> 07:03.830
My Lord.

07:18.830 --> 07:21.040
If I hadn't come to Shicheng,
I wouldn't have known

07:21.040 --> 07:22.480
that such a major incident had occurred—

07:22.480 --> 07:23.630
the annihilation
of an entire envoy mission.

07:23.630 --> 07:24.510
The Shicheng garrison commander

07:24.510 --> 07:26.070
is on bereavement leave
at a time like this,

07:26.070 --> 07:28.070
and the court actually approved it.

07:28.120 --> 07:30.920
How could there be
such a coincidence in the world?

07:37.680 --> 07:38.190
My Lord.

07:38.870 --> 07:40.350
If I may speak out of turn,

07:40.680 --> 07:41.270
could you

07:41.270 --> 07:42.430
not only care about Miss Gu,

07:42.430 --> 07:44.120
but also take a little care of yourself?

07:44.120 --> 07:45.390
You're coughing like this,

07:45.390 --> 07:46.450
-and yet…
-Enough.

07:46.750 --> 07:48.550
Who said I care about Gu Jinzhao?

07:49.560 --> 07:50.240
I care about nothing

07:50.240 --> 07:51.970
but the vast realm of Great Yan.

07:52.560 --> 07:53.310
Help!

07:53.409 --> 07:54.700
Save me!

07:54.750 --> 07:55.409
Gu Jinzhao?

07:59.600 --> 08:00.260
Gu Jinzhao!

08:09.430 --> 08:10.190
Ye Xian.

08:27.160 --> 08:31.010
♪ Moonlight spills over the lapels of
my gown ♪

08:34.070 --> 08:38.690
♪ My longing receives no reply ♪

08:40.419 --> 08:45.710
♪ Wind rises, silently dissipating
from my heart ♪

08:48.850 --> 08:54.780
♪ That is the morning I missed ♪

08:56.740 --> 09:00.590
♪ Ink stains spread on the letter paper ♪

08:58.320 --> 08:59.450
What a coincidence—

08:59.910 --> 09:01.170
running into you here.

09:04.130 --> 09:07.850
♪ Outlining an unfinished poem ♪

09:10.010 --> 09:15.760
♪ Lamplight gently flickers
at the corners of my eyes ♪

09:10.770 --> 09:13.960
[Peace Across the World]

09:18.240 --> 09:23.430
♪ Reflecting the empty memories ♪

09:24.040 --> 09:28.030
♪ I gently murmur your name ♪

09:26.600 --> 09:28.360
Chen Yanyun has luck on his side.

09:28.360 --> 09:29.440
Don't worry too much.

09:28.660 --> 09:31.770
♪ Like snowflakes falling into the palm ♪

09:30.750 --> 09:32.240
I'll go out of the city tomorrow

09:32.240 --> 09:33.150
and find a way

09:32.290 --> 09:35.320
♪ Before I can hold them up
for you to see clearly ♪

09:33.600 --> 09:35.200
to gather more information.

09:35.270 --> 09:36.240
Listen to me.

09:35.970 --> 09:38.780
♪ They have already melted into teardrops
falling into my hands ♪

09:37.200 --> 09:38.260
Tomorrow morning,

09:38.390 --> 09:39.510
you and Guard Li

09:39.650 --> 09:42.720
♪ I gently write of parting ♪

09:39.870 --> 09:42.070
will take everyone back to the capital.

09:43.650 --> 09:46.880
♪ Like fleeting fireflies
losing their trace ♪

09:44.030 --> 09:45.490
Why should I listen to you?

09:46.270 --> 09:47.400
I came here this time

09:47.480 --> 09:49.270
to search beyond the pass.

09:47.800 --> 09:50.070
♪ Before I can inscribe the ending ♪

09:50.660 --> 09:54.060
♪ It was already destined, in this life,
hard to promise each other ♪

09:52.030 --> 09:52.670
I know.

09:53.480 --> 09:55.200
If I can't find him beyond the pass,

09:55.200 --> 09:56.910
I'll go to the northern frontier

09:56.910 --> 09:58.840
and search the Beiman khan's camp.

10:00.630 --> 10:01.490
I know that too.

10:03.790 --> 10:05.720
Do you understand what I'm saying?

10:05.720 --> 10:07.780
Following me like this is dangerous.

10:08.080 --> 10:08.750
You are not

10:08.750 --> 10:09.720
alone.

10:09.930 --> 10:11.120
You still have Lady Ye

10:11.120 --> 10:12.780
and Fifth Aunt to think about.

10:12.870 --> 10:14.530
Can you stop being so willful?

10:15.840 --> 10:16.480
I'm tired.

10:17.150 --> 10:18.410
I'm going back to rest.

10:21.250 --> 10:23.410
[Peace Across the World]

10:25.880 --> 10:26.940
What's that sound?

10:26.940 --> 10:28.740
It should be the city gate alarm.

10:33.200 --> 10:33.660
My Lord,

10:33.970 --> 10:34.670
a large troop of men

10:34.670 --> 10:36.070
is coming from the north.

10:36.200 --> 10:37.030
We need to withdraw immediately.

10:37.030 --> 10:38.690
Could it be the Beiman people?

10:39.350 --> 10:39.870
Zhao.

10:41.210 --> 10:42.340
Something big is about to happen.

10:42.340 --> 10:43.320
We need to leave right away.

10:43.320 --> 10:44.120
I can't leave.

10:45.080 --> 10:45.630
My Lord.

10:46.240 --> 10:47.700
The Shicheng garrison commander has fled.

10:47.700 --> 10:49.560
This vast city is left with troops

10:49.700 --> 10:50.900
but no one in command.

10:51.990 --> 10:52.870
Since I'm here,

10:53.080 --> 10:53.880
I won't leave.

10:54.460 --> 10:55.190
Li Xianhuai.

10:55.390 --> 10:56.600
Bring pen and ink at once.

10:56.600 --> 10:58.440
I will write to warn Menyuan and Yixian.

10:58.440 --> 10:58.870
Hurry!

10:58.870 --> 10:59.270
Yes.

11:00.150 --> 11:00.790
Ye Xian.

11:01.970 --> 11:03.210
I can't escort you anymore.

11:03.210 --> 11:05.000
I need to go to the garrison headquarters.

11:05.000 --> 11:07.400
I hope these troops
can still hold the line.

11:07.600 --> 11:08.460
Leave quickly.

11:08.630 --> 11:09.600
The faster, the better.

11:09.600 --> 11:10.260
Head south.

11:10.670 --> 11:11.240
But...

11:11.240 --> 11:12.030
No buts.

11:12.630 --> 11:14.000
I am a military noble of Great Yan.

11:14.000 --> 11:15.600
I will not abandon the city and flee.

11:15.600 --> 11:16.460
Leave quickly.

11:18.150 --> 11:18.630
Okay.

11:19.390 --> 11:20.870
Be careful.

11:21.250 --> 11:22.850
I'll wait for you in Menyuan.

11:30.090 --> 11:31.290
Beiman have invaded—

11:31.600 --> 11:32.720
this may be an undeclared war.

11:32.530 --> 11:35.060
[Your Majesty, at midnight,
a thousand Beiman cavalry crossed in.]

11:54.440 --> 12:00.410
[Shicheng]

12:03.330 --> 12:04.090
Hyah!

12:07.480 --> 12:08.080
Hyah!

12:17.750 --> 12:18.360
Hyah!

12:31.790 --> 12:32.750
Yao.

12:33.840 --> 12:34.840
Yao!

12:46.960 --> 12:48.200
Where am I?

12:56.870 --> 12:57.940
What do you want?

13:11.250 --> 13:12.560
What are you doing?

13:13.240 --> 13:15.560
What are you doing? Let me go!

13:16.120 --> 13:17.150
Let me go!

13:25.480 --> 13:26.340
Stay away!

13:30.670 --> 13:32.080
Don't come near me!

13:39.000 --> 13:40.000
Let me go!

13:40.200 --> 13:41.240
Let me go!

13:41.790 --> 13:43.030
Let me go!

14:17.960 --> 14:18.840
Third Master.

14:22.630 --> 14:23.960
Many of my subordinates

14:24.010 --> 14:25.040
have followed me

14:25.060 --> 14:26.580
for years.

14:27.550 --> 14:28.390
Most of them

14:29.150 --> 14:30.280
are highly skilled.

14:31.120 --> 14:33.050
If you ever run into trouble again,

14:33.470 --> 14:34.990
you can blow this whistle.

15:45.670 --> 15:46.660
Third Master.

15:47.030 --> 15:48.480
Why did you come so late?

15:54.020 --> 15:56.500
Why did you come so late?

16:56.910 --> 16:57.630
Jinzhao,

16:58.390 --> 16:59.600
I will take you back.

17:01.020 --> 17:03.020
[Huxiao Gorge]

17:07.310 --> 17:07.910
Thank you.

17:10.829 --> 17:11.599
Thank you.

17:12.200 --> 17:12.720
I finally managed

17:12.720 --> 17:13.880
to escape from the rebel army

17:13.880 --> 17:14.750
at the border market.

17:14.750 --> 17:15.349
Thank you.

17:15.550 --> 17:17.150
And now there's another war.

17:17.960 --> 17:19.480
My life is just miserable.

17:20.720 --> 17:21.990
You've got it easy.

17:22.240 --> 17:23.030
-We men
-If anyone needs more,

17:23.030 --> 17:23.920
-from the Capital Garrison
- give them extra.

17:23.920 --> 17:24.920
have had it rough.

17:25.589 --> 17:26.930
First we were picked to

17:27.270 --> 17:28.270
escort the envoy mission

17:28.270 --> 17:30.270
all the way to Beiman,

17:30.550 --> 17:31.270
and just

17:31.440 --> 17:33.040
when we were about to arrive,

17:33.110 --> 17:34.960
remnants of Chunyuan showed up

17:34.960 --> 17:35.960
trying to kill us.

17:36.200 --> 17:38.260
And all of it was ordered by the court.

17:40.010 --> 17:41.770
[Lady Weirui]

17:40.640 --> 17:42.350
Isn't this
the Senior Grand Secretary's wife?

17:42.350 --> 17:44.080
As the Senior Grand Secretary,

17:44.240 --> 17:45.910
he actually harbors bandits
to build up his own power

17:45.910 --> 17:47.640
and colludes with foreign enemies.

17:47.640 --> 17:48.480
So you mean,

17:48.790 --> 17:50.190
those Chunyuan remnants

17:50.550 --> 17:51.640
are ostensibly helping Great Yan

17:51.640 --> 17:53.210
negotiate peace with Beiman,

17:53.210 --> 17:54.680
but in secret,

17:55.350 --> 17:57.280
they have long defected to Beiman.

17:57.350 --> 17:58.110
Exactly.

17:59.790 --> 18:00.740
Now the truth

18:01.200 --> 18:02.640
is now about to come to light.

18:02.640 --> 18:04.390
[Lady Weirui]

18:04.110 --> 18:05.440
Mentor originally wanted

18:05.440 --> 18:07.070
to use the Chunyuan remnants

18:07.310 --> 18:09.170
to collude with the Beiman court,

18:10.310 --> 18:11.510
and then seize control

18:11.510 --> 18:13.240
of the court
by manipulating military affairs

18:13.240 --> 18:14.900
along Nine Border Garrisons.

18:15.310 --> 18:17.360
But he never expected to be used in turn

18:17.360 --> 18:19.090
by the second prince of Beiman.

18:19.830 --> 18:21.910
All the food and weapons here

18:22.270 --> 18:23.790
were also supplied
by the Chunyuan remnants

18:23.790 --> 18:24.920
to support Beiman's

18:25.070 --> 18:26.650
southward advance.

18:30.350 --> 18:31.240
Mentor

18:33.110 --> 18:35.370
spent his whole life plotting every step

18:35.590 --> 18:37.320
with meticulous calculation,

18:38.270 --> 18:39.110
only to end up

18:40.280 --> 18:42.340
being used by Beiman people himself.

18:42.790 --> 18:43.990
To seek a tiger's hide

18:44.200 --> 18:45.800
is to invite being devoured.

18:46.510 --> 18:47.920
Even if he was being used,

18:48.680 --> 18:50.480
it's no different from treason.

18:51.680 --> 18:52.810
When Shicheng fell,

18:53.720 --> 18:54.310
I already sent someone

18:54.310 --> 18:56.310
at full speed to report to the court.

18:56.640 --> 18:58.040
I expect reinforcements

18:58.240 --> 18:59.840
will arrive within ten days.

19:00.000 --> 19:00.680
I'm afraid

19:02.110 --> 19:03.160
this letter may never

19:03.160 --> 19:04.590
reach the court.

19:05.750 --> 19:07.610
I know Fu Hailian has great power.

19:07.920 --> 19:09.650
But this is a foreign invasion.

19:09.790 --> 19:10.240
Would he really

19:10.240 --> 19:11.310
let such chaos

19:11.830 --> 19:12.960
go unchecked

19:12.960 --> 19:13.960
just to save face?

19:15.590 --> 19:16.590
What does he want?

19:17.070 --> 19:18.730
To surrender without a fight?

19:23.280 --> 19:25.080
What he fears isn't losing face,

19:25.760 --> 19:27.610
but the reckoning after the war—

19:28.200 --> 19:29.200
especially since

19:30.130 --> 19:31.590
he still thinks I'm alive.

19:33.400 --> 19:34.030
Report!

19:34.550 --> 19:35.080
My lord.

19:35.350 --> 19:36.230
A Beiman army

19:36.270 --> 19:38.130
is heading towards Huxiao Gorge.

19:40.430 --> 19:41.430
How many?

19:41.550 --> 19:42.720
About eight hundred.

19:42.720 --> 19:44.200
How long until they arrive?

19:44.200 --> 19:45.460
They're moving slowly

19:45.480 --> 19:46.720
and carrying supplies.

19:46.720 --> 19:47.200
Roughly

19:47.350 --> 19:48.400
four hours away.

19:58.550 --> 19:59.160
Ergou,

19:59.350 --> 20:01.010
I see you've packed your bags.

20:01.070 --> 20:02.270
When are you leaving?

20:07.790 --> 20:10.220
Who… who said I'm leaving?

20:11.510 --> 20:12.160
Qingpu,

20:12.750 --> 20:13.900
go find Third Master

20:14.000 --> 20:16.130
and tell him about the situation here.

20:16.270 --> 20:16.790
Yes.

20:27.720 --> 20:28.550
Yixian is the last line

20:28.550 --> 20:30.070
of defense at the frontier.

20:30.070 --> 20:31.420
Once Yixian falls,

20:31.550 --> 20:32.280
enemy forces

20:32.640 --> 20:33.900
will be able to advance

20:34.200 --> 20:35.600
straight to Zijing Pass.

20:36.030 --> 20:36.680
By then,

20:38.030 --> 20:39.630
they'll be at the city walls,

20:40.030 --> 20:42.030
directly threatening the capital.

20:43.640 --> 20:44.900
How many men do we have?

20:45.750 --> 20:46.550
Four hundred.

20:46.750 --> 20:48.720
Four hundred against eight hundred.

20:48.720 --> 20:50.250
Though we are outnumbered,

20:50.350 --> 20:52.150
Huxiao Gorge is rugged terrain—

20:52.680 --> 20:54.410
easy to defend, hard to attack.

20:54.680 --> 20:56.280
We're in the shadows as well.

20:58.070 --> 20:59.680
This is not a fight we can't take.

20:59.680 --> 21:00.480
Third Master.

21:02.240 --> 21:03.040
Third Master.

21:03.200 --> 21:04.130
Several people in the barracks,

21:04.130 --> 21:05.350
upon hearing that
the Beiman army is coming,

21:05.350 --> 21:06.680
are clamoring to leave.

21:06.790 --> 21:08.350
Madam has also had Miss Qingpu

21:08.350 --> 21:09.150
send word that

21:09.920 --> 21:11.070
morale is very low.

21:15.510 --> 21:16.070
Got it.

21:16.350 --> 21:17.550
I am thinking of a way.

21:19.750 --> 21:20.270
Yes.

21:23.510 --> 21:24.310
Fortunately,

21:24.680 --> 21:26.340
many of these four hundred men

21:27.240 --> 21:28.200
are veterans

21:28.720 --> 21:30.110
who once fought Beiman

21:30.110 --> 21:30.920
with Marquis Changxing

21:30.920 --> 21:32.680
and Marquis Jingyuan.

21:34.160 --> 21:35.420
What do you want to say?

21:41.640 --> 21:42.240
I want

21:43.480 --> 21:45.140
to borrow something from you.

21:46.790 --> 21:47.550
What is it?

21:49.790 --> 21:51.390
The surname of the Ye family.

22:02.720 --> 22:04.780
If we don't run now, it'll be too late.

22:06.510 --> 22:07.620
You want to leave?

22:07.880 --> 22:09.340
But no one else is leaving.

22:11.400 --> 22:12.720
If you want to leave, then go.

22:12.720 --> 22:14.050
Stop talking nonsense.

22:14.920 --> 22:16.510
Soldiers fleeing without a fight,

22:16.510 --> 22:17.920
and you still have the nerve to yell.

22:17.920 --> 22:18.920
Have you no shame?

22:21.310 --> 22:23.110
I'm just discussing it with you.

22:35.530 --> 22:37.390
[Ye]

22:41.550 --> 22:43.350
Isn't our leader surnamed Chen?

22:43.640 --> 22:44.410
What does

22:44.510 --> 22:45.570
the "Ye" mean then?

22:46.620 --> 22:47.530
The Ye Army?

23:02.320 --> 23:04.170
[Ye]

23:08.960 --> 23:10.290
It really is the Ye Army!

23:10.920 --> 23:11.720
The Ye Army!

23:11.720 --> 23:14.440
-Let's go. It's the Ye Army.
-The Ye Army.

23:14.570 --> 23:15.360
The Ye Army.

23:18.240 --> 23:18.940
It really is the Ye Army.

23:18.940 --> 23:19.790
Yes.

23:27.970 --> 23:31.170
[Ye]

23:33.210 --> 23:34.110
Marquis.

23:34.640 --> 23:35.900
Marquis Changxing!

23:36.480 --> 23:37.400
Fall in!

23:39.320 --> 23:41.690
[Ye]

23:40.790 --> 23:41.750
Cao Yiming, Squad Leader of
the Sixth Banner, First Company,

23:41.750 --> 23:43.350
Third Division of the Ye Army's
Armored Cavalry Battalion,

23:43.350 --> 23:44.320
reporting back to the ranks!

23:44.320 --> 23:45.590
Zhao Tietou of the Third Banner,
Third Company,

23:45.590 --> 23:47.070
Second Division of the Ye Army's
Infantry Battalion C,

23:47.070 --> 23:48.240
reporting back to the ranks!

23:48.240 --> 23:49.160
Rong Qixiang, Wagon Master
of the First Company,

23:49.160 --> 23:49.960
Fourth Division of the Ye Army's
Logistics Battalion,

23:49.960 --> 23:50.640
reporting back to the ranks!

23:50.640 --> 23:51.720
The Fourth Banner, Fifth Company,

23:51.720 --> 23:52.750
Third Division of the Ye Army's
Infantry Battalion B,

23:52.750 --> 23:53.510
Li Jichang of the Second Banner,
Third Company, Second Division

23:53.510 --> 23:55.000
-reporting back to the ranks!
-of the Ye Army's Infantry Battalion B,

23:55.000 --> 23:56.590
reporting back to the ranks!

23:56.590 --> 23:57.440
Zhao Baoshan of the Third Banner,
Second Company,

23:57.440 --> 23:58.680
First Division of
the Ye Army's Armored Cavalry Battalion,

23:58.680 --> 23:59.400
reporting back to the ranks!

23:59.400 --> 24:00.400
Jin Qianli, Wagon Master
of the First Company,

24:00.400 --> 24:01.030
Third Division of the Ye Family Army's

24:01.030 --> 24:01.550
Logistics Battalion,

24:01.550 --> 24:03.150
reporting back to the ranks!

24:11.790 --> 24:12.310
Good!

24:14.960 --> 24:17.010
[Ye]

24:17.920 --> 24:19.140
The armor he wears...

24:19.960 --> 24:21.690
It belonged to the Old Marquis.

24:22.880 --> 24:23.810
The late Emperor

24:24.280 --> 24:25.920
once specially bestowed
the Red Feather Helmet

24:25.920 --> 24:26.950
upon the old Marquis

24:26.950 --> 24:27.880
in recognition of

24:27.880 --> 24:30.210
his outstanding military achievements.

24:30.560 --> 24:32.020
Back then, the old Marquis

24:32.110 --> 24:33.200
swept through

24:33.270 --> 24:34.510
the frontier undefeated,

24:34.510 --> 24:35.870
and the Beiman people trembled

24:35.870 --> 24:36.820
at his name.

24:37.610 --> 24:38.620
Now, Ye Xian

24:40.110 --> 24:40.830
has not disgraced

24:40.830 --> 24:42.830
the prestige of Marquis Changxing.

24:44.350 --> 24:45.620
Let me ask you all.

24:45.880 --> 24:46.880
Thirty years ago,

24:47.400 --> 24:48.110
when my father

24:48.110 --> 24:50.840
led the Ye Army
in a bloody battle at Suolong Pass,

24:50.880 --> 24:52.810
did he ever retreat even half a step

24:53.070 --> 24:54.220
because his armor was not secure?

24:54.220 --> 24:57.550
Never! Never!

24:57.580 --> 24:58.710
Eighteen years ago,

24:59.070 --> 25:00.910
when the Baishui River burst its banks,

25:00.910 --> 25:02.840
my father personally led brave men

25:02.960 --> 25:04.710
to form a human wall
to protect the people.

25:04.710 --> 25:06.370
Did he abandon the people

25:06.510 --> 25:07.750
because of the towering muddy waves?

25:07.750 --> 25:10.510
Never! Never!

25:11.070 --> 25:12.170
Ten years ago,

25:12.790 --> 25:14.110
the eighteen riders of
the Black Armor Battalion

25:14.110 --> 25:15.790
crossed Mount Cuiwei at night.

25:15.790 --> 25:17.440
Facing enemies ten times their number,

25:17.440 --> 25:19.030
they still slew generals
and seized banners.

25:19.030 --> 25:20.920
Did a single man of the Ye family

25:20.920 --> 25:22.640
ever bow his head to the barbarians?

25:22.640 --> 25:25.350
Fight to the death! Fight to the death!

25:25.350 --> 25:25.830
Good!

25:26.630 --> 25:28.540
You are all fine men of the Ye Army.

25:29.070 --> 25:30.840
Beiman may have eight hundred men,

25:30.840 --> 25:33.240
but the Ye Army has fought
ten to one before.

25:33.310 --> 25:35.310
We have never lost and never feared!

25:35.840 --> 25:36.960
Today, Lord Chen and I

25:36.960 --> 25:38.640
stand with you against the enemy.

25:38.640 --> 25:39.700
I promise you this—

25:40.000 --> 25:41.320
ten taels of silver

25:41.550 --> 25:43.010
for every enemy beheaded,

25:43.720 --> 25:45.240
and three ranks of promotion

25:45.240 --> 25:46.560
for whoever captures
the enemy leader alive!

25:46.560 --> 25:48.240
Leave them utterly destroyed!

25:48.240 --> 25:50.510
Kill! Kill! Kill!

25:50.530 --> 25:52.910
Kill! Kill! Kill!

25:52.940 --> 25:55.140
Kill! Kill! Kill!

25:55.160 --> 25:57.480
Kill! Kill! Kill!

25:57.290 --> 26:01.790
[Ye]

26:05.590 --> 26:06.850
Make sure to stay safe.

26:08.350 --> 26:09.750
Make sure you stay alive.

26:11.220 --> 26:12.150
After we win,

26:12.830 --> 26:14.750
we're still going to drink
Zhaoyebai together.

26:14.750 --> 26:15.240
Okay.

26:17.070 --> 26:17.670
Take care.

26:17.710 --> 26:18.310
Take care.

26:21.160 --> 26:21.690
Let's go.

26:39.160 --> 26:39.960
What's wrong?

26:40.400 --> 26:41.000
Nothing.

26:42.240 --> 26:43.540
I was just thinking,

26:44.680 --> 26:45.270
if...

26:47.880 --> 26:49.880
if the old Marquis were still alive,

26:49.960 --> 26:51.270
he'd be so proud

26:51.790 --> 26:52.960
to see you today.

26:59.240 --> 27:00.970
I'll go outside and take a look.

27:19.710 --> 27:22.710
[Ye]

27:30.310 --> 27:34.050
[Ye]

27:35.400 --> 27:36.830
We need to cut more cloth.

27:38.240 --> 27:38.770
Okay.

27:39.240 --> 27:40.700
I'll go look for some then.

27:48.480 --> 27:51.210
This is all the medicine
for wounds we could find.

27:55.680 --> 27:56.620
Having this much

27:56.750 --> 27:58.550
is already better than nothing.

28:31.900 --> 28:33.100
Don't worry too much.

28:33.680 --> 28:35.110
Third Master and Young Lord Ye

28:35.110 --> 28:36.470
will both be fine.

28:40.160 --> 28:40.830
Yao.

28:42.070 --> 28:43.530
I'm worried about you too.

28:43.830 --> 28:45.290
If you are truly in danger,

28:45.880 --> 28:46.760
remember,

28:46.960 --> 28:47.890
leave if you can.

28:48.160 --> 28:48.960
I won't leave.

28:52.110 --> 28:54.130
Although our Ji family are merchants,

28:54.130 --> 28:56.060
our resolve to protect the country

28:56.440 --> 28:58.100
is no less than anyone else's.

29:39.110 --> 29:42.110
[Tiehaye, Commander of Beiman]

29:51.550 --> 29:52.680
Something's wrong.

29:53.350 --> 29:54.240
What's wrong, Third Master?

29:54.240 --> 29:55.590
There are no supplies with them.

29:55.590 --> 29:56.810
That means they split
their eight hundred men

29:56.810 --> 29:57.750
into two groups.

29:58.270 --> 30:00.000
These are the first four hundred—

30:00.000 --> 30:01.480
there are another
four hundred behind them.

30:01.480 --> 30:02.680
Then what should we do?

30:02.680 --> 30:03.480
It's too late

30:03.480 --> 30:04.330
to change the plan now.

30:04.330 --> 30:05.640
We proceed as planned,

30:05.640 --> 30:06.440
but we must move fast.

30:06.440 --> 30:07.100
Otherwise,

30:08.070 --> 30:08.640
we will end up

30:08.640 --> 30:10.110
being wiped out by

30:10.110 --> 30:11.910
this other Beiman army instead.

30:12.030 --> 30:13.640
Go inform Young Lord Ye immediately!

30:13.640 --> 30:14.110
Yes.

30:30.750 --> 30:32.150
[Deputy Commander of Beiban]

31:03.960 --> 31:04.750
Fire!

31:08.200 --> 31:08.880
Form up!

31:11.440 --> 31:12.310
It's an ambush!

31:12.640 --> 31:13.440
Form up!

31:14.880 --> 31:15.960
It's an ambush!

31:23.920 --> 31:24.420
Loose arrows!

31:24.420 --> 31:25.220
Loose arrows!

31:41.000 --> 31:41.640
Fire!

31:44.480 --> 31:45.390
Attack!

32:13.750 --> 32:20.240
Kill!

32:53.750 --> 32:55.420
Report!

32:57.030 --> 32:58.200
The enemy has fallen into our ambush

32:58.200 --> 32:59.510
is now fighting our army.

32:59.510 --> 33:00.710
How is the situation?

33:00.830 --> 33:02.090
We have the upper hand.

33:02.550 --> 33:03.350
Keep scouting.

33:03.350 --> 33:03.790
Yes.

33:10.820 --> 33:11.690
Attack!

33:12.350 --> 33:16.790
Kill!

33:25.310 --> 33:26.370
That direction...

33:26.590 --> 33:27.650
it's Young Lord Ye.

34:14.630 --> 34:15.760
It's the Ye Army!

34:15.880 --> 34:17.710
Kill them!

34:27.820 --> 34:29.060
The Ye Army,

34:29.630 --> 34:30.760
attack!

36:17.710 --> 36:18.920
Archers, ready!

36:20.920 --> 36:21.480
Fire!

36:23.030 --> 36:23.710
Ready!

36:24.260 --> 36:25.050
Fire!

36:34.480 --> 36:35.100
Report!

36:35.590 --> 36:37.080
The enemy's eight hundred troops
have split into two forces.

36:37.080 --> 36:38.550
Four hundred are in the rear.

36:38.550 --> 36:40.350
Lord Chen orders a swift battle.

37:22.360 --> 37:23.160
Third Master.

37:57.960 --> 37:59.090
You dog of Great Yan.

38:02.670 --> 38:03.940
I'll kill you!

38:14.740 --> 38:16.290
[Ye]

38:15.480 --> 38:17.120
Report!

38:17.400 --> 38:18.110
How is it?

38:18.230 --> 38:19.030
The situation is bad.

38:19.030 --> 38:20.230
We are losing ground.

38:22.590 --> 38:24.110
The Beiman people are strong—

38:24.110 --> 38:25.370
one man can take on ten.

38:25.670 --> 38:27.400
We are already a remnant force,

38:27.550 --> 38:29.350
and now the firelocks are spent.

38:29.400 --> 38:30.330
In close combat,

38:30.400 --> 38:32.200
we stand no chance against them.

38:33.110 --> 38:33.670
I'll go help.

38:33.670 --> 38:34.150
No.

38:34.760 --> 38:35.070
Yao.

38:35.070 --> 38:36.000
It's dangerous.

38:36.110 --> 38:37.710
I am an official of Great Yan.

38:37.760 --> 38:38.280
I will go.

38:38.280 --> 38:38.680
But...

38:38.920 --> 38:39.640
No buts.

38:40.030 --> 38:40.670
Stay here

38:41.360 --> 38:42.690
and protect the people.

38:46.830 --> 38:47.280
You,

38:47.300 --> 38:47.800
and you,

38:48.320 --> 38:48.840
come with me.

38:48.840 --> 38:49.110
Yes.

38:49.280 --> 38:49.670
Yes.

39:30.590 --> 39:31.670
Too weak.

39:35.100 --> 39:36.230
Go support the rear.

39:36.800 --> 39:37.190
Yes.

39:39.070 --> 39:39.440
Go.

40:15.640 --> 40:16.900
Protect His Lordship!

40:31.920 --> 40:32.550
Archers,

40:33.440 --> 40:34.320
fire!

40:57.650 --> 40:59.260
[Ye]

40:59.310 --> 41:00.560
Report!

41:01.030 --> 41:02.400
Our forces are no match for Beiman

41:02.400 --> 41:03.110
and have suffered heavy casualties.

41:03.110 --> 41:04.590
Four hundred enemy reinforcements
are advancing fast.

41:04.590 --> 41:06.590
They're no more than 200 paces away.

41:14.120 --> 41:15.350
Zhao.

41:15.440 --> 41:16.170
You can't go.

41:18.310 --> 41:20.510
There are still so many civilians here.

41:20.880 --> 41:21.360
Are you going to

41:21.360 --> 41:22.480
leave them behind?

42:27.280 --> 42:28.440
Charge through!

42:53.500 --> 42:54.690
Young

42:55.510 --> 42:57.220
Lord...

44:08.070 --> 44:08.760
My

44:09.920 --> 44:10.510
Lord...

44:27.760 --> 44:28.440
My Lord!

44:47.920 --> 44:48.800
My Lord.

44:51.150 --> 44:52.780
You must

44:53.480 --> 44:55.280
live on.

45:32.530 --> 45:36.220
[A Splendid Match]
